              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "18.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " babeera Omwami Yesu ne bang'oosi, mala bakhunyaasia efwe. Bali bakhasiimisia Wele tawe! Bali basiku bayingania buli mundu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lundi bakhaka khukhukhiingilila efwe khulekhe khwilwacha burume khu Be Chikholo, burume bunyala bwabareerera buonia. Mu ngila ng'eneyo bamalile elala khukhwichusia esaabu eye bubwoni bwabwe. Ne luno lirima lia Wele liamalile khubechakho!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Liliekoomba lia Paulo khubakeniia lundi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne efwe, bawandaayefwe, nga khwaba ne khwaukhaane nanywe khu siise sitiiti mu mubili, se khwamurusia mumebaasio kefwe tawe, khwamwikoombile mala khwakhaka lukali khumukeniye lundi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwenyile khwiche lundi. Ese samwene nakhakile lukali khukhwicha, ne kakhali Sietani se enya khwiche tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kakhaba kario, enywe muli, lilieyikina liefwe, liliekhoya liefwe, ne sifuno siefwe sie khukhwibonia khu bukhili bwefwe ebweeni wo Mwami Yesu nga ne akheeche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ali enywe muli liliebonia liefwe ne liliekhoya liefwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
